<title>EL SALVADOR: SOCCER-EL SALVADOR BEAT CUBA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EL SALVADOR BEAT CUBA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador beat Cuba 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a CONCACAF semi-final stage group two World</p>
<p>Cup qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: William Renderos (4th minute), Raul Diaz Arce</p>
<p>(32nd), Jorge Rodriguez (50th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Canada	   5  4  1  0  8  1 13</p>
<p> El Salvador    5  3  1  1 12  4 10</p>
<p> Cuba	     5  1  0  4  3 13  3</p>
<p> Panama	   5  0  2  3  5 10  2</p>
<p>Remaining games: December 15 El Salvador v Canada, Panama</p>
<p>v Cuba.</p>
<p>Note: Canada and El Salvador qualify for the final round</p>
<p>of the CONCACAF qualifying competition.</p>
</text>
